  "name": "XML declaration \u2014 EC transitional registry quarterly submission, two goods lines",
  "why": "This is the official EC declaration format, so its parse is the one case where a third party defines the input and we cannot change it. The unit conversions are the risk: netMassTonnes becomes kilograms and directEmissions becomes kgCO2e, both by a factor of 1000. A silent inversion or dropped multiplier there is a thousand-fold error in a filed figure, and nothing downstream would flag it as implausible.",
